1  How to Use This Document
Work through each phase in order — each phase gates the next. Every test has a checkbox (☐ open / ☑ pass / ☒ fail). Record results as you go. A Phase Gate table at the end of each phase must be fully signed off before proceeding.
The document was built from a full review of the ARCHER_9 repository plus the complete conversation history with the Antigravity team. It reflects the final agreed system design.

Symbol	Status	Meaning	Action Required
☐	OPEN	Not yet tested	Run test, record outcome
☑	PASS	Completed and passed	Log date + tester initials
☒	FAIL	Completed and failed	Open bug ticket; block phase advance
⚠	OBSERVE	Requires human judgment	Reviewer must evaluate manually
 
